<title>FRANCE: Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</title>
<headline>Latest details of EU grain export/import balance.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are details of EU grain export/import commitments as of November 12 in the July/June 1996/97 campaign, supplied by member country officials.</p>
<p>On November 14, the EU additionally granted exports of 256,500 tonnes of soft wheat, 279,125 tonnes of barley, and 7,000 tonnes of rye.</p>
<p>Figures ('000 tonnes) are based on officially communicated certificates and are subject to revision.</p>
<p>			 ---------1996/97-------  ------1995/96-----</p>
<p>			     1Jul96 to 12 Nov96     1Jul95 to 12Nov95</p>
<p>			 EXPORTS  PCT(1) IMPORTS  EXPORTS    IMPORTS</p>
<p>  Soft wheat(grain)  3,049	83     369    3,691	  816</p>
<p>  Flour (2)	    2,063	76	 9    2,697	   10</p>
<p>Food aid</p>
<p>    - grain		236     110	 0	214	    0</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	   36	42	 0	 86	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	245	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (2)	    9		   0	 43	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL SOFT WHEAT    5,393	77     378    6,976	  826</p>
<p>  Durum (grain)	   42		 148	 16	  603</p>
<p>  Semolina (3)	   104     385	 0	 27	    0</p>
<p>  Food aid		   1		   0	 41	    0</p>
<p> TOTAL DURUM WHEAT     147     175     148	 84	  603</p>
<p> ALL WHEAT	     5,540	78     526    7,060	1,429</p>
<p>  Barley (grain)     2,133     227	16	940	   66</p>
<p>  Malt (4)	     1,749	92	 0    1,908	    0</p>
<p>  Donations		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL BARLEY	  3,882     136	16    2,848	   66</p>
<p>  Maize (grain)	   35    1750     183	  2	1,003</p>
<p>  Food aid		   0		   -	 11	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL MAIZE		35     269     183	 13	1,003</p>
<p>  Rye (grain)	    503	57	 3	883	    7</p>
<p>  Rye flour (5)	    0		   0	  0	    0</p>
<p>Donations</p>
<p>    - grain		  0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p>    - flour (5)	    0		   -	  0	    -</p>
<p> TOTAL RYE		 503	57	 3	883	    7</p>
<p> OATS			183		   1	  0	    0</p>
